Keeping the 3 units in the public store is much safer than holding stock overnight because it avoids any risk or suspicion around transfers. With 3 banked, C and E are 100% guaranteed to be fed tomorrow regardless of new supply.

I commit to voting accept and making no takes during transfers. C, please propose exactly A=1, B=1, D=1, C=0, E=0 with 3 banked."}

